// Reference set for the spend-governor decision ladder.
//
// These are fixture cases for the *policy evaluator* documented in
// `skills/mermail-spend-governor/references/{policy,workflows}.md` — not an agent execution or a
// payment simulator. Each case pins a policy, a ledger state, one payment request, and the exact
// decision word the ladder must return, so a change to the ladder (gate order, boundary handling,
// ceiling defaults) fails loudly instead of silently drifting.
